OL,3,GNEWSAJewish groups miss out on attack
OL,4,Arecovery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #600,000 fund set up after the deadly
OL,7,Fattack on Heaton Park Synagogue has
OL,8,Fsparked criticism after none of the
OL,9,Fmoney was given directly to Jewish
OL,10,Forganisations.
OL,12,FThe funding was awarded to Salford City
OL,13,FCouncil as part of a government
OL,14,Frecovery programme following the attack
OL,15,Fduring Yom Kippur last year, in which
OL,16,FMelvin Cravitz and Adrian Daulby were
OL,17,Fkilled.
