OL,3,GNEWSAJewish groups miss out on attack
OL,4,Arecovery funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leaders said the money would
OL,7,Fsupport projects tackling antisemitism,
OL,8,Fracism and division, but local
OL,9,Fcommunity leaders have questioned how
OL,10,Fit has been distributed.
OL,12,FA council spokesperson said the
OL,13,Fauthority stood "in solidarity" with
OL,14,Fthe Jewish community and had provided
OL,15,Fsupport to Jewish organisations and
OL,16,Fcommunities.
